sequenceDiagram
  autonumber
  actor T as Talento
  participant API as API Candidaturas (S3)
  participant S1 as S1 Talentos
  participant S2 as S2 Empresas/Missões
  participant DB as DB S3
  participant OB as Outbox
  participant BR as Broker
  participant W4 as Worker S4
  participant W5 as Worker S5

  T->>API: POST /v1/missions/{id}/applications (idempotency key opt)
  API->>API: autenticação/autorização (S7)
  API->>S1: validar talento existe
  S1-->>API: ok
  API->>S2: validar missão publicada/elegível
  S2-->>API: ok
  API->>DB: BEGIN TX
  API->>DB: INSERT application (talent_id, mission_id) [UNIQUE]
  API->>DB: INSERT application_history (estado inicial)
  API->>OB: INSERT outbox application.created
  API->>DB: COMMIT
  API-->>T: 201 Created {applicationId, status}
  OB->>BR: (relay) publicar application.created
  BR->>W4: entregar evento
  W4->>W4: criar notificação, persistir, enviar
  BR->>W5: entregar evento
  W5->>W5: atualizar métricas

  Note over API,DB: Duplicidade simultânea: UNIQUE violação -> 409 Conflict
  Note over OB,BR: Publicação é at-least-once; duplicated event tolerated by consumers (eventId)